{
  "_doc": "ability.actions.<name>(props) → our Act. kind: card = acts on the ability's selection (default context.source → s:\"self\"; inside a `target` block → s:\"target\"); player = acts on a player (default: `default`; explicit `target: context.player[.opponent]` flips `opp` when the DSL k has `oppField`); token = no selection (makeToken); flow = sequential/joint, flattened. defaults = fields written when the prop is absent (keyteki setDefaultProperties). props: every keyteki prop the entry understands — {field} copies a literal, {ifTrue}/{ifFalse} merge fields on a boolean literal (null deletes a field). Anything not listed (and not cosmetic) is Unsupported(\"prop:<name>\"): fail closed. pending/unsupported entries only document the reason; the code is always action:<name>. Lote 15c (action-zones): archive/removeStun/removeAmber espelham atos que o motor ja tem (archive/unstun/moveAmber->supply). placeAmber (supply -> criatura) NAO tem ato (o capture debita um pool) = engineGap do relatorio; putIntoArchives/moveCard/discard de zona seguem o move do DSL em entradas futuras.",
